  "introText": "Hey guys! I’m BUDDY! Today, we’ll practice two sounds that are almost opposite, but we mix them up. They’re... …NOW and NO! Two vowels in one sound, going different ways: now x no\n\nIn now, house and down the mouth opens wide first, then closes. In no, home and don’t the lips are round from the very beginning.",
